    <briefdescription>
<para>An implementation of <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_binary_stream" kindref="compound">BinaryStream</ref> which holds its entire data set in a single contiguous buffer. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><ref refid="classllvm_1_1_binary_byte_stream" kindref="compound">BinaryByteStream</ref> guarantees that no read operation will ever incur a copy. Note that <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_binary_byte_stream" kindref="compound">BinaryByteStream</ref> does not own the underlying buffer. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
